{"page":401,"verses":[{"verse_key":"29:39","surah":29,"ayah":39,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَـٰرُونَ وَفِرْعَوْنَ وَهَـٰمَـٰنَ ۖ وَلَقَدْ جَآءَهُم مُّوسَىٰ بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ فَٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَمَا كَانُوا۟ سَـٰبِقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Remember] Qarun and Pharaoh and Haman: Moses brought them clear signs, but they behaved arrogantly on earth. They could not escape Us","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَـٰرُونَ","en_gloss":"And Qarun","transliteration":"waqārūna","verse_key":"29:39"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَفِرْعَوْنَ","en_gloss":"and Firaun","transliteration":"wafir'ʿawna","verse_key":"29:39"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَهَـٰمَـٰنَ ۖ","en_gloss":"and Haman","transliteration":"wahāmāna","verse_key":"29:39"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"29:39"},{"pos":5,"ar":"جَآءَهُم","en_gloss":"came to them","transliteration":"jāahum","verse_key":"29:39"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مُّوسَىٰ","en_gloss":"Musa","transliteration":"mūsā","verse_key":"29:39"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"with clear evidences","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","verse_key":"29:39"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"but they were arrogant","transliteration":"fa-is'takbarū","verse_key":"29:39"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"29:39"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"29:39"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"29:39"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they could","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"29:39"},{"pos":13,"ar":"سَـٰبِقِينَ","en_gloss":"outstrip Us","transliteration":"sābiqīna","verse_key":"29:39"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٣٩","en_gloss":"(39)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:39"}]},{"verse_key":"29:40","surah":29,"ayah":40,"ar_uthmani":"فَكُلًّا أَخَذْنَا بِذَنۢبِهِۦ ۖ فَمِنْهُم مَّنْ أَرْسَلْنَا عَلَيْهِ حَاصِبًا وَمِنْهُم مَّنْ أَخَذَتْهُ ٱلصَّيْحَةُ وَمِنْهُم مَّنْ خَسَفْنَا بِهِ ٱلْ