aled to you of the Scripture; keep up the prayer: prayer restrains outrageous and unacceptable behaviour. Remembering God is greater: God knows everything you are doing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱتْلُ","en_gloss":"Recite","transliteration":"ut'lu","verse_key":"29:45"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"29:45"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أُوحِىَ","en_gloss":"has been revealed","transliteration":"ūḥiya","verse_key":"29:45"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"29:45"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"29:45"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"29:45"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَأَقِمِ","en_gloss":"and establish","transliteration":"wa-aqimi","verse_key":"29:45"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ ۖ","en_gloss":"the prayer","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","verse_key":"29:45"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"29:45"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","en_gloss":"the prayer","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","verse_key":"29:45"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَنْهَىٰ","en_gloss":"prevents","transliteration":"tanhā","verse_key":"29:45"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"29:45"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْفَحْشَآءِ","en_gloss":"the immorality","transliteration":"l-faḥshāi","verse_key":"29:45"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَٱلْمُنكَرِ ۗ","en_gloss":"and evil deeds","transliteration":"wal-munkari","verse_key":"29:45"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَلَذِكْرُ","en_gloss":"and surely (the) remembrance","transliteration":"waladhik'ru","verse_key":"29:45"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"29:45"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أَكْبَرُ ۗ","en_gloss":"(is) greatest","transliteration":"akbaru","verse_key":"29:45"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"29:45"},{"pos":19,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"knows","